      "signpost": "who owns it",
      "definition": "used before a noun to ask or say which person or thing something belongs to",
      "explanation": "**Whose** asks about ownership (*Whose coat is this?*) or, in a relative clause, shows that something belongs to the person or thing just named (*the woman whose car broke down*).",
